      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "THREEFOLD (4) comes here following a win over 1200m at Hughenden two-and-a-half weeks ago, getting home by 0.6 lengths. Is very effective at this distance with two wins from eight runs and best figures have her right in the mix. MANIC LIGHT (2) finished fifth last time out over 1100m at Julia Creek, beaten 3.5 lengths. Has a decent record at this venue with a win and three minor placings from five starts. Will be hard to beat. REGAL JUDGEMENT (3) returns from a spell of 11 weeks and did win first-up last time in work over 1300m at Barcaldine. Can run a race while fresh. FLY FIFER (7) last raced on July 5 when beaten 6 lengths into 11th at Townsville over 1300m. Finds the right race this time and can find winning form again.",
